  "description": "You wake up to the main character from your web comic literally in the flesh. What would you do? The story follows Mae, an anxious but endearing artist dealing with the line her childhood friend; Elias now BOSS has drew between them. Seemingly a different person, Mae decides to stay behind that line he set but for Raiden, The warrior from her comic it's the exact opposite! No longer bound by panels Raiden wants to love and protect Mei! Wait a minute, does that say Mei?\n\n(Source: Line Webtoon)",
